,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":19716.8,"ev_to_ebitda":13.7,"debt_to_ebitda":3.05,"net_debt_to_ebitda":2.93,"f_score":6,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 10.2%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $1,510M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 73.4%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.22"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":-9.73,"default_fair_val":-9.73,"premium_pct":-3257,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":18.1,"pe_forward":15.9,"pb_trailing":7,"pb_forward":6.3,"div_yield":1.66,"ps_ratio":13.6,"fcf_to_ev":1.45,"fcf_to_mcap":1.84,"liab_to_assets":73.4,"cash_to_assets":1.9,"current_ratio":0.22,"roe":38.9,"roa":10.2,"moat":{"ticker":"RCL","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"皇家加勒比郵輪在郵輪產業中擁有強大的品牌聲譽，尤其是在高端市場，這使其具備一定的定價權。其品牌如「皇家加勒比」和「名人郵輪」在消費者心中建立了信任和高品質的形象。然而，郵輪產業本質上仍受經濟週期影響，且面臨來自其他旅遊方式（如航空、陸地旅遊）的競爭，以及同業間的價格戰。儘管如此，其品牌忠誠度和差異化體驗，使其在特定客群中能維持較高的價格水平，但非絕對的壟斷性定價能力。","comment_en":"Royal Caribbean Cruises possesses a strong brand reputation within the cruise industry, particularly in the premium segment, granting it a degree of pricing power. Brands like 'Royal Caribbean' and 'Celebrity Cruises' have established trust and an image of high quality in consumers' minds. However, the cruise industry is inherently susceptible to economic cycles and faces competition from alternative travel methods (air, land) and price wars among peers. Despite this, its brand loyalty and differentiated experiences allow it to maintain relatively higher price points for specific customer segments, though not absolute monopolistic pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"郵輪產業的進入壁壘主要來自於高昂的資本支出和營運複雜性，而非專利或特許經營權。皇家加勒比並無獨特的專利技術或受政府保護的特許經營權，其主要競爭優勢來自於營運效率和品牌。雖然有嚴格的安全和環保法規，但這些法規對所有參與者都適用，並未形成對皇家加勒比的獨特優勢。因此，在專利和特許權方面，其護城河相當薄弱。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the cruise industry stem primarily from high capital expenditures and operational complexity, rather than patents or exclusive franchises. Royal Caribbean does not possess unique patented technologies or government-protected franchises; its primary competitive advantages arise from operational efficiency and brand. While stringent safety and environmental regulations exist, these apply to all participants and do not confer a unique advantage to Royal Caribbean. Consequently, its moat in terms of patents and franchises is quite weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"郵輪旅遊的轉換成本相對較低。一旦預訂，更改行程或選擇其他公司可能會產生額外費用或不便，但消費者並非被深度綁定。忠誠度計畫（如皇家金階俱樂部）確實能鼓勵重複消費，但其吸引力主要在於累積積分和額外福利，而非嚴格的技術或合約限制。與企業軟體或金融服務相比，客戶更換郵輪公司的門檻較低，因此轉換成本的護城河屬於中等水平。","comment_en":"Switching costs for cruise travel are relatively low. Once a booking is made, changing itineraries or choosing another company might incur additional fees or inconvenience, but consumers are not deeply locked in. Loyalty programs (like the Crown & Anchor Society) do encourage repeat business, but their appeal lies mainly in accumulating points and extra benefits, rather than strict technical or contractual limitations. Compared to enterprise software or financial services, the threshold for customers to switch cruise lines is lower, thus the moat from switching costs is moderate."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"皇家加勒比郵輪的網絡效應非常有限。其業務模式主要基於提供服務給獨立的消費者，而非依賴用戶間的互動來增加價值。雖然龐大的客戶基礎和口碑傳播能帶來一定的間接效益，但這並非典型的網絡效應，即用戶越多，服務對每個用戶的價值就越大。其競爭優勢更多來自於產品本身的吸引力、服務品質和價格，而非網絡效應。","comment_en":"Network effects for Royal Caribbean Cruises are very limited. Its business model primarily involves providing services to individual consumers, rather than relying on user-to-user interactions to increase value. While a large customer base and word-of-mouth can bring some indirect benefits, this is not a typical network effect where more users directly increase the service's value for each user. Its competitive advantages stem more from the inherent appeal of its offerings, service quality, and price, rather than network effects."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為全球最大的郵輪公司之一，皇家加勒比在採購、船舶建造、燃料、行銷和人力資源等方面享有顯著的規模經濟優勢。龐大的船隊使其能夠以更低的單位成本獲得更好的談判條件，並將這些成本節約轉化為競爭優勢。這種規模優勢使其在價格競爭中更具彈性，並能支持其在全球範圍內提供多樣化的航線和產品，是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"As one of the world's largest cruise companies, Royal Caribbean enjoys significant economies of scale in procurement, shipbuilding, fuel, marketing, and human resources. Its vast fleet allows it to secure better negotiation terms at lower unit costs, translating these savings into a competitive advantage. This scale advantage provides greater flexibility in price competition and supports its ability to offer diverse itineraries and products globally, forming a substantial moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"皇家加勒比擁有獨特的地理資產，例如其在巴哈馬的私人島嶼（如可可灣、拉巴第海灘），這些是其他郵輪公司難以複製的。這些私人島嶼提供了獨特的旅遊體驗，增強了產品的吸引力，並有助於鎖定客戶。此外，其航線遍佈全球熱門旅遊目的地，雖然這些目的地並非獨有，但其龐大的網絡和對這些地點的深入了解，也構成了一種無形的地理資產優勢。","comment_en":"Royal Caribbean possesses unique geographical assets, such as its private islands in the Bahamas (e.g., CocoCay, Labadee), which are difficult for other cruise lines to replicate. These private islands offer unique travel experiences, enhancing product appeal and helping to retain customers. Furthermore, its itineraries cover popular global tourist destinations. While these destinations are not exclusive, its extensive network and deep knowledge of these locations also constitute an intangible geographical asset advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"皇家加勒比在營運效率方面表現出色，體現在其高載客率、優化的航線規劃、以及對成本的嚴格控制上。公司持續投資於新技術和船舶設計，以提高燃油效率和降低營運成本。其卓越的後勤管理和服務標準，確保了客戶體驗的一致性，這對於維持品牌聲譽和客戶忠誠度至關重要。高營運效率直接轉化為更高的獲利能力和更強的競爭力。","comment_en":"Royal Caribbean excels in operational efficiency, reflected in its high occupancy rates, optimized itinerary planning, and stringent cost controls. The company continuously invests in new technologies and ship designs to improve fuel efficiency and reduce operating costs. Its superior logistics management and service standards ensure consistent customer experiences, crucial for maintaining brand reputation and customer loyalty. High operational efficiency directly translates into greater profitability and stronger competitiveness."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"皇家加勒比展現了相對穩健的資本配置能力。儘管負債水平較高，但公司在擴張船隊、升級現有資產以及適時回購股票之間取得了平衡。其對新船投資的決策通常基於對長期市場需求的判斷，並注重提升單位收益。在疫情後，公司積極管理債務，並專注於恢復盈利能力，顯示出管理層在艱難時期進行資源分配的審慎態度。","comment_en":"Royal Caribbean demonstrates a relatively sound capital allocation capability. Despite a significant debt load, the company balances expansion of its fleet, upgrading existing assets, and timely share repurchases. Decisions on new ship investments are typically based on assessments of long-term market demand, with a focus on enhancing yield per unit. Post-pandemic, the company has actively managed its debt and focused on restoring profitability, indicating management's prudent approach to resource allocation during challenging times."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"透過其忠誠度計畫「皇家金階俱樂部」以及提供差異化的郵輪體驗，皇家加勒比在客戶留存方面做得相當不錯。該計畫透過積分和會員等級制度，鼓勵乘客再次選擇皇家加勒比的產品。結合其品牌吸引力和不斷創新的郵輪產品（如綠洲級、 قامت級），公司能夠吸引並留住對特定體驗有偏好的客戶群體。雖然轉換成本不高，但良好的客戶關係管理和產品差異化是其留存的關鍵。","comment_en":"Through its loyalty program, the 'Crown & Anchor Society,' and by offering differentiated cruise experiences, Royal Caribbean achieves considerable customer retention. The program, with its points and tier system, encourages passengers to choose Royal Caribbean's offerings repeatedly. Combined with its brand appeal and continuously innovative cruise products (like the Oasis and Icon classes), the company can attract and retain customer segments with preferences for specific experiences. Although switching costs are not high, strong customer relationship management and product differentiation are key to its retention."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"郵輪產業的長期可持續性面臨挑戰，包括經濟週期的波動、地緣政治風險、以及日益嚴格的環保法規。皇家加勒比作為行業領導者，透過持續的品牌建設、規模優勢和營運效率，展現了一定的韌性。然而，其業務模式本質上對外部衝擊（如疫情、油價波動、全球經濟衰退）較為敏感。儘管公司努力透過創新和多元化來應對，但其護城河的持久性仍受到宏觀經濟環境和行業結構性變化的影響。","comment_en":"The long-term sustainability of the cruise industry faces challenges, including economic cycle fluctuations, geopolitical risks, and increasingly stringent environmental regulations. As an industry leader, Royal Caribbean demonstrates a degree of resilience through continuous brand building, scale advantages, and operational efficiency. However, its business model is inherently sensitive to external shocks (like pandemics, oil price volatility, global economic downturns). Despite the company's efforts to mitigate these through innovation and diversification, the durability of its moat is still influenced by the macroeconomic environment and structural industry changes."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"皇家加勒比郵輪（RCL）展現了強勁的經濟護城河，主要來自於其顯著的規模經濟優勢（M5）和卓越的營運效率（M7），這使其在成本控制和服務提供上領先同業。其強大的品牌聲譽（M1）和獨特的地理資產（M6），如私人島嶼，也提供了差異化競爭力。客戶留存（M9）透過忠誠度計畫得到鞏固。然而，轉換成本（M3）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，且專利/特許（M2）幾乎不存在。整體而言，RCL 擁有一個類似於「收費橋」的護城河，依賴於其龐大的基礎設施和品牌吸引力來吸引並服務大量客戶，但其持久性（M10）受經濟週期影響較大，且缺乏專利等絕對壁壘。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Royal Caribbean Cruises (RCL) exhibits a strong economic moat, primarily derived from its significant economies of scale (M5) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), enabling it to lead competitors in cost control and service delivery. Its robust brand reputation (M1) and unique geographical assets (M6), such as private islands, also provide competitive differentiation. Customer retention (M9) is reinforced through its loyalty program. However, switching costs (M3) and network effects (M4) are relatively weak, and patents/franchises (M2) are virtually non-existent. Overall, RCL possesses a 'toll bridge'-like moat, relying on its vast infrastructure and brand appeal to attract and serve a large customer base, though its durability (M10) is significantly influenced by economic cycles, and it lacks absolute barriers like patents.","evidenceHash":"452d13f0b1f2a7d4d6aaea3237e0ceea8f02587dd91f69fd2e1d242f6d376f4b","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T01:54:29.054Z","evidenceHash":"f908ac8f78e3699781a10f65be53d60e0e6c0c7448abe96b6764b2377aa3fb8d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T01:54:29.054Z","evidenceHash":"f908ac8f78e3699781a10f65be53d60e0e6c0c7448abe96b6764b2377aa3fb8d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RCL.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RCL.png","website":"https://www.rclinvestor.com","ceo":"Jason T. Liberty","full_time_employees":"107975","description":"Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd. is a prominent global operator within the cruise sector. The company manages several well-known cruise lines, such as Royal Caribbean International, Celebrity Cruises, Azamara, and Silversea Cruises. Through these brands, it offers a wide array of voyages that call upon approximately 1,000 different destinations across the globe. As of February 25, 2022, its expansive fleet comprised 61 vessels. Established in 1968, the company's corporate headquarters are situated in Miami, Florida.","description_en":"Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd. is a prominent global operator within the cruise sector. The company manages several well-known cruise lines, such as Royal Caribbean International, Celebrity Cruises, Azamara, and Silversea Cruises. Through these brands, it offers a wide array of voyages that call upon approximately 1,000 different destinations across the globe. As of February 25, 2022, its expansive fleet comprised 61 vessels. Established in 1968, the company's corporate headquarters are situated in Miami, Florida.","description_zh":"Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd.（美股代碼：RCL）為 Consumer Cyclical 領域之重要企業，專注於 Travel Services 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"1050 Caribbean Way","city":"Miami","state":"FL","zip":"33132-2096","country":"US","phone":"305 539 6000","full_address":"1050 Caribbean Way, Miami, FL 33132-2096, US","range_52w":"222.22-356.39","year_high":356.39,"year_low":222.22,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":222.22,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-30","name":"Montiel Maritza Gomez","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":400,"price":307.21,"total_val":0.12},{"date":"2026-10-30","name":"Lake Robert Alexander","title":"officer: SVP,  CLO & Secretary","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1000,"price":298.43,"total_val":0.3},{"date":"2026-08-03","name":"Bunch Tara","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":683,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-31","name":"Bayley Michael W","title":"officer: Pres&CEO, Royal Caribbean Intl","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":12811,"price":315.99,"total_val":4.05},{"date":"2026-07-30","name":"Wiernicki Christopher J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":571,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-2